From 590e8136b1fab3fe5602377dec4c80567e82550b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x4pro-emu <kf1178@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 14:51:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/17] xteink-x4pro: GPIO block, SPI2 master, e-paper panel
 device, board state

- hw/gpio/esp32s3_gpio_full.c: full GPIO register block with per-pin idle levels,
  external drivers, edge/level interrupts.
- hw/ssi/esp32s3_gpspi.c: GP-SPI master (CPU-driven path) on an SSIBus.
- hw/display/x4pro_epd.c: panel device around models/epd_core.c (symlinked):
  SSD1677 / UC8179 / UC8279, bit-banged probe answers, BUSY timer, QemuConsole.
- xteink_x4pro.c: wiring, x4pro.input (buttons, charging) and x4pro.board (state JSON).
